sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Teknisi
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant FCM as Firebase FCM

    T->>App: Buka tab Job Board
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/bookings/open
    API->>DB: SELECT bookings WHERE status = open
    DB-->>API: List booking terbuka
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>T: Tampilkan daftar job tersedia

    T->>App: Pilih booking lalu tap Claim
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/claim

    API->>DB: SELECT status FROM bookings WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>API: Status booking saat ini

    alt Booking masih OPEN
        API->>DB: UPDATE status = in_progress, technician_id, claimed_at
        DB-->>API: Berhasil
        API->>FCM: Push notifikasi ke Manager dan Client
        FCM-->>API: OK
        API-->>App: 200 OK Booking berhasil diklaim
        App-->>T: Navigasi ke halaman My Jobs
    else Booking sudah diklaim teknisi lain
        API-->>App: 409 Conflict
        App-->>T: Tampilkan pesan error
    end
